WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:33.670
It was an early fall morning.

2
00:00:33.671 --> 00:00:37.816
The air was chilly.

3
00:00:37.817 --> 00:00:44.031
Kip rubbed his paws to keep warm.

4
00:00:44.032 --> 00:00:45.767
Kip looked down.

5
00:00:45.768 --> 00:00:50.135
Bird was doing something in her nest.

6
00:00:50.136 --> 00:00:53.961
Kip didn't see what it was.

7
00:00:53.962 --> 00:00:59.872
He could only see something green and yellow.

8
00:00:59.873 --> 00:01:03.597
"Hey, Bird!" said Kip.

9
00:01:03.598 --> 00:01:08.396
"What are you doing?"

10
00:01:08.397 --> 00:01:11.000
"Nothing," said Bird.

11
00:01:11.001 --> 00:01:14.109
Kip climbed down to Bird's branch.

12
00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:20.076
"Can I see?" asked Kip.

13
00:01:20.077 --> 00:01:25.900
"No," said Bird.

14
00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:30.520
Bird turned her back to Kip.

15
00:01:30.521 --> 00:01:36.075
"Come on," said Kip.

16
00:01:36.076 --> 00:01:45.466
"Tell me what you're doing."

17
00:01:45.467 --> 00:01:48.166
"No," said Bird.

18
00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:51.555
"Please?" said Kip.

19
00:01:51.556 --> 00:02:02.410
"No," said Bird. "I'm not telling you."

20
00:02:02.411 --> 00:02:08.555
Kip tried to peek around Bird.

21
00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:13.963
Bird moved to the side.

22
00:02:13.964 --> 00:02:19.242
Kip tried to peek over Bird.

23
00:02:19.243 --> 00:02:25.222
Bird raised her shoulders.

24
00:02:25.223 --> 00:02:29.318
"Why won't you tell me?" asked Kip.

25
00:02:29.319 --> 00:02:32.166
Bird got angry.

26
00:02:32.167 --> 00:02:36.742
"Because it's a secret, Kip!" cried Bird.
